      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Uber is a ride-sharing platforms that connect passengers with drivers who offer transportation services \nin personal vehicles. It allows users to book rides on-demand from their smartphones, matching them \nwith a nearby driver who will take them from their location to their desired destination.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Uber is a ride-sharing platforms that connect passengers with drivers who offer transportation services \nin personal vehicles. It allows users to book rides on-demand from their smartphones, matching them \nwith a nearby driver who will take them from their location to their desired destination.",
