      "originalText": "💡 Partial Indexes: Only index rows you actually query (e.g., pending tasks)\n   → Smaller indexes, faster writes, better cache utilization\n\n🎯 Covering Indexes: Include extra columns to avoid table lookups\n   → Faster reads for specific queries, but larger index size",
